# 统一换行符：仓库以 LF 存储，检出时强制 LF（解决 Windows/Linux 双系统 CRLF/LF 差异）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不转换，避免损坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.tgz binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.jar binary
